<p id="S7.SS1.p1.4" class="ltx_p">For the first term in (<a href="#S7.E30" title="In VII-A Proof of Theorem 1 ‣ VII Appendix ‣ Wireless Federated Multi-Task LLM Fine-Tuning via Sparse-and-Orthogonal LoRA" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">30</span></a>), we have</p>
